<title>UK: British election diary - March 27.</title>
<headline>British election diary - March 27.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-03-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Following are the main election campaign-related events scheduled for Thursday.</p>
<p>- Labour party's economics spokesman Gordon Brown and deputy economics spokeswoman Dawn Primarolo holds news conference at Millbank Towers, 1000 GMT.</p>
<p>- Chancellor of the Exchequer Kenneth Clarke and Environment Secretary John Gummer hold news conference at Conservative Central Office, 1030 GMT.</p>
<p>- Prime Minister John Major visits Huntingdonshire.</p>
<p>-  London Newsroom +44 171 542 7947</p>
